Error: Jet.PipeValueOutsideStep: `<>` is outside a pipe step or an `if` table header
  --> Tests/UI/pipe_value_outside_step.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(<> + port)
    |           ^^
 Why: `<>` is the value a `|> step` receives from the line above, or the place each arm's candidate takes in an `if` table header; here it is neither
 Fix: Move it into a step such as `value |> f(<>)`, or write the value itself
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.PipeValueOutsideStep
